=== PARITY (vs web FSMHealthPanel.tsx) ===
  Data sources (web → native P1/S8 source seam):
    transitions prop (parent-owned)  → FSMHealthPanelSource → FSMHealthPanelUpdate
    useTranslation                   → FSMHealthPanelStrings facade (P1/S10)
  Verbatim web logic ported + unit-pinned (the `useMemo` body + exported computeFlapIds):
    flap   = per fsm_name, sort by ts, any window (ts_i, ts_i+60_000] with `count > 5`
             flags every row in it; the warning alert is pushed ONCE with the running
             flapped size at first push (web quirk reproduced; `flapIds` = full set).
    stuck  = latest transition per `fsm_name:vehicle_id` for drive_session/charge_session,
             to_state in {pending,active}, (now − ts) > 4h (STRICT). warning.
    recovery = count of to_state == "recovered". info.
    render = alerts.length===0 ? all-clear row : "FSM Health" title + grid of cards.
  Composition: GlassPanel (web GlassPanel) → TSGlassPanel · Grid cols={{default:1,
    md:alerts.length}} → adaptive LazyVGrid · lucide AlertTriangle/Timer/RotateCw →
    SF Symbols exclamationmark.triangle.fill / timer / arrow.clockwise · amber/blue
    severity tints → Color.TS.statusWarning / statusInfo (0.06 bg, 0.2 border) ·
    fmtInt(count) → FSMHealthFormat.count (grouped) · message {{count}} → raw count.
  States (all render, never a blank box): loading(skeleton) · healthy(web all-clear,
